[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Which Book?]
[00:00.50]Lesson 21 | 第21课
[00:02.52]Which book? | 哪本书？
[00:04.90]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:10.81]Which book does the man want? | 这位男士想要哪本书？
[00:15.60]Give me a book please, Jane. | 给我一本书，简。
[00:19.84]Which book? | 哪本书？
[00:21.57]This one? | 这本吗？
[00:23.52]No, not that one. The red one. | 不，不是那本。是红色的那本。
[00:28.91]This one? | 这本吗？
[00:30.67]Yes, please. | 是的，谢谢。
[00:32.62]Here you are. | 给你。
[00:34.42]Thank you. | 谢谢你。